  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Transparency International Brazil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Transparency International-Chapter in Brazil. Support to the TI Brazil infrastructure (Operations Office, Advocacy and Anticorruption Knowledge Centre). Support to a strong permanent presence in Brazil, in order to contribute to the fight against corruption, with special focus on local governance, business and environment. Main target groups are the Brazilian civil society, government, private sector and academia, and BRICS, Mercosur, G20 and Global South.</narrative>
  </description>
